    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this well presented three bedroom mid terraced house in the Riverside town of Carrick on Shannon. Located within walking distance of all town centre amenities such as shops, schools, restaurants, hotels, riverside walks and Carrick on Shannon train station which serves the Dublin/Sligo line (6 trains daily) . Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, wc, kitchen/ diner with range of wall and base units, living room with double doors leading to well maintained garden area (with storage sheds), stairs to first floor comprising of three good sized bedrooms (one with ensuite), built in wardrobes & family bathroom. Parking to the front of the property. The house has recently been newly carpeted. Ideal Starter Home or Investment Property. For all viewings contact Gallagher Auctioneers on 0719621000."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 6.1m (20'0\") x 1.76m (5'9\")\r\n\r\nWC 1.81m (5'11\") x 1.39m (4'7\")\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner 6.35m (20'10\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\r\n\r\nLiving Room 5.14m (16'10\") x 4m (13'1\")\r\n\r\nStairs to First Floor \r\n\r\nLanding 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.53m (11'7\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\r\n\r\nEnsuite 3.3m (10'10\") x 1.67m (5'6\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 4.03m (13'3\") x 2.45m (8'0\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 4.32m (14'2\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.58m (8'6\") x 1.7m (5'7\")"
      },
      {
